    "abstract": "Parts figure for the wing lower cover between ribs 8 and 14 on the four-engine stretched aircraft, showing the stringer kits, the spar cap, the skin panel and the harness clamping across the run-out region.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the lower cover items in the stringer run-out region between ribs 8 and 14, including the reinforced stringer kit and the harness clamps that move with it.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the left wing lower cover looking up with the tank access panels removed; the right wing is a mirror image. Sheet 2 shows the run-out detail at a single stringer. The run-out region is called out as one panel assembly: the stringer, the spar cap and the skin panel are listed individually but there is one standard of each. Clamp positions at item 50 are dimensioned from the rib stations on sheet 2."
    },
